            "last_updated": "2026-11-05",
            "snippet": "BIS Hanoi celebrates outstanding IGCSE results 2025\n22 August, 2025\n# BIS Hanoi celebrates outstanding IGCSE results 2025\n1. 2. News\n3. BIS Hanoi celebrates outstanding IGCSE results 2025\nThis year’s results have been truly exceptional, placing BIS Hanoi students far ahead of the average in England.\n...\nTuesday (August 19) was a big day for our Year 12 students as they finally received their IGCSE results, a moment filled with excitement, relief, and plenty of proud smiles.\nThese results represent more than just grades; they tell the story of two years of determination, resilience, and growth.\nThis year’s results have been truly exceptional, placing BIS Hanoi students far ahead of the average in England.\n#### Our IGCSE results highlights:\n- 46% of grades awarded were A* or A, compared to 23% in England\n- 85% of grades awarded were A–C, compared to 55% in England\n- 35% of our students achieved one or more A*/A grades.\n- 6 students achieved a perfect set of A* and A grades.\n...\nThese results open doors and give every student a solid foundation upon which to build in the IBDP and BIS Diploma in Years 12 and 13.\nOur students’ achievements in both the IBDP (Year 13) and IGCSE (Year 11) programmes are exceptional, not just this year, but every year to date, and are consistently the best of any school in Hanoi.",
