            "snippet": "# Record-Breaking IGCSE 2025 Results at BVIS Hanoi\nBVIS Hanoi celebrates record-breaking IGCSE 2025 results: 45% A*–A, 68% A*–B, and 100% pass rate.\n...\n##### FIND OUT WHAT MAKES OUR SCHOOL SPECIAL\nOutstanding Academic Performance\nThe 2025 IGCSE examinations have set a new benchmark for our students’ success:\n• 45% of all entries achieved grades A*–A (256 exam papers)\n• 68% of entries achieved A*–B (384 exam papers)\n• 100% pass rate across all subjects\nThis record-breaking performance represents a significant improvement from 2024, when 35% of entries were awarded A*–A grades.\nIt also exceeds our internal predictions, underlining the commitment, hard work, and determination of our Year 11 students, supported every step of the way by their dedicated teachers.\n...\n#### Celebrating Our Students\nAs we look ahead, we remain committed to supporting every student at BVIS Hanoi to achieve not only excellent exam results, but also the confidence, creativity, and compassion to thrive in university and beyond.",
